#ASSERT NOT (`s 1 — the Law governs` `a matter whose context is inconsistent with the Law`)  -- S020 [Law s.1 L22]
#ASSERT `s 2 — the defined term bears its definition in` (`a use of the term` `in the enactment that defines it` `the term itself` FALSE FALSE) `, for` `a matter nothing displaces`  -- S022 [Law s.2 L25] (the defining enactment)
#ASSERT `s 2 — the defined term bears its definition in` (`a use of the term` `in regulations made under the enactment that defines it` `the term itself` FALSE FALSE) `, for` `a matter nothing displaces`  -- S022b [Law s.2 L25] (regulations under A)
