§§ `H. Ordinance s 1 definitions (words in statutes given before 1981-10-01)`

-- Helpers for the Ordinance's records (positional arguments, in the order the declaration lists the fields).
GIVEN ordinary IS A BOOLEAN
      company IS A BOOLEAN
      incorporated IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A candidate person`
`a candidate person` MEANS `A candidate person` WITH `a person in the ordinary sense` IS ordinary, `a company, association or body of persons` IS company, `incorporated` IS incorporated, `a company` IS FALSE, `an association` IS FALSE, `a body of persons` IS FALSE

GIVEN navigation IS A BOOLEAN
      oarsOnly IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A navigable thing`
`a navigable thing` MEANS `A navigable thing` WITH `used for navigation` IS navigation, `propelled by oars or paddles only` IS oarsOnly

GIVEN ordinary IS A BOOLEAN
      partOfHouse IS A BOOLEAN
      structure IS A BOOLEAN
      dwelt IS A BOOLEAN
      intended IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A building or place`
`a building or place` MEANS `A building or place` WITH `a house in the ordinary sense` IS ordinary, `a part of a house` IS partOfHouse, `a building or other structure` IS structure, `people dwell in it or occupy it, by right or otherwise, by day or night` IS dwelt, `it was intended for dwelling or occupation` IS intended, `wholly or partly below the surface of the ground` IS FALSE, `a building` IS FALSE, `another structure` IS FALSE

GIVEN supreme IS A BOOLEAN
      capacity IS A `A capacity of the Supreme Court`
GIVETH A `A sitting of a court`
`a sitting` MEANS `A sitting of a court` WITH `the Supreme Court` IS supreme, `the capacity in which it sits` IS capacity

GIVEN ordinary IS A BOOLEAN
      presents IS A BOOLEAN
      visible IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A presentation of words or numerals`
`a presentation of words` MEANS `A presentation of words or numerals` WITH `writing in the ordinary sense` IS ordinary, `presents words or numerals, or copies them` IS presents, `in a form visible to the eye` IS visible, `by printing` IS FALSE, `by lithography` IS FALSE, `by typewriting` IS FALSE, `by photography` IS FALSE

`an Ordinance Knesset act` MEANS `A candidate statute under the Ordinance` WITH `a legislative act of the Knesset` IS TRUE, `an ordinance given by the Provisional Council of State` IS FALSE, `an ordinance lawfully given in Palestine before the State was established` IS FALSE, `this Ordinance itself` IS FALSE
`an Ordinance Provisional Council ordinance` MEANS `A candidate statute under the Ordinance` WITH `a legislative act of the Knesset` IS FALSE, `an ordinance given by the Provisional Council of State` IS TRUE, `an ordinance lawfully given in Palestine before the State was established` IS FALSE, `this Ordinance itself` IS FALSE
`an Ordinance Mandate-era ordinance` MEANS `A candidate statute under the Ordinance` WITH `a legislative act of the Knesset` IS FALSE, `an ordinance given by the Provisional Council of State` IS FALSE, `an ordinance lawfully given in Palestine before the State was established` IS TRUE, `this Ordinance itself` IS FALSE
`this Ordinance as a candidate` MEANS `A candidate statute under the Ordinance` WITH `a legislative act of the Knesset` IS FALSE, `an ordinance given by the Provisional Council of State` IS FALSE, `an ordinance lawfully given in Palestine before the State was established` IS FALSE, `this Ordinance itself` IS TRUE
`no Ordinance statute` MEANS `A candidate statute under the Ordinance` WITH `a legislative act of the Knesset` IS FALSE, `an ordinance given by the Provisional Council of State` IS FALSE, `an ordinance lawfully given in Palestine before the State was established` IS FALSE, `this Ordinance itself` IS FALSE

GIVEN statute IS A `A candidate statute under the Ordinance`
      byVirtue IS A MAYBE `A candidate statute under the Ordinance`
      britishAct IS A BOOLEAN
      listedKind IS A BOOLEAN
      byAuthority IS A BOOLEAN
      onBasis IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `An instrument under the Ordinance`
`an Ordinance instrument` MEANS `An instrument under the Ordinance` WITH `taken as a statute` IS statute, `the statute it was given by virtue of` IS byVirtue, `given by virtue of an Act of the British Parliament or an Order in Council` IS britishAct, `a regulation, rule, by-law, proclamation, manifesto, order, direction, notice, announcement or other document` IS listedKind, `given by an authority in Palestine or in Israel` IS byAuthority, `given on the basis of a regulation, rule or by-law of that kind` IS onBasis, `a regulation` IS FALSE, `a rule` IS FALSE, `a by-law` IS FALSE, `a manifesto` IS FALSE, `a proclamation` IS FALSE, `an order` IS FALSE, `a direction` IS FALSE, `a notice` IS FALSE, `an announcement` IS FALSE, `another document` IS FALSE

GIVEN ordinary IS A BOOLEAN
      affirmation IS A BOOLEAN
      docBearing IS A BOOLEAN
      permitted IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A sworn or affirmed statement`
`a sworn or affirmed statement` MEANS `A sworn or affirmed statement` WITH `a declaration on oath or an oath in the ordinary sense` IS ordinary, `an affirmation` IS affirmation, `a document bearing an affirmation` IS docBearing, `a declaration by a person whom a law permits an affirmation or declaration in place of an oath` IS permitted

GIVEN ordinary IS A BOOLEAN
      cannotWrite IS A BOOLEAN
      mark IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A signature`
`a signature` MEANS `A signature` WITH `a signature in the ordinary sense` IS ordinary, `by a person who cannot write his name` IS cannotWrite, `a mark` IS mark

GIVEN into IS A BOOLEAN
      out IS A BOOLEAN
      doneOrCaused IS A BOOLEAN
      seaLandAir IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A movement across Israel's border`
`a movement` MEANS `A movement across Israel's border` WITH `into Israel` IS into, `out of Israel` IS out, `done, or caused to be done` IS doneOrCaused, `by sea, land or air` IS seaLandAir, `by sea` IS FALSE, `by land` IS FALSE, `by air` IS FALSE

GIVEN ordinary IS A BOOLEAN
      works IS A BOOLEAN
      master IS A BOOLEAN
      navigator IS A BOOLEAN
      apprentice IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A person aboard a ship`
`a person aboard` MEANS `A person aboard a ship` WITH `a seaman in the ordinary sense` IS ordinary, `works on a ship or is employed on it in any capacity` IS works, `the master` IS master, `a navigator` IS navigator, `an apprentice bound by a contract and properly registered` IS apprentice, `works on a ship` IS FALSE, `is employed on a ship in any capacity` IS FALSE

GIVEN ship IS A `A navigable thing`
      boat IS A BOOLEAN
      raft IS A BOOLEAN
      other IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A floating thing`
`a floating thing` MEANS `A floating thing` WITH `its facts as a ship` IS ship, `a boat` IS boat, `a raft` IS raft, `any other thing made to float` IS other

GIVEN control IS A BOOLEAN
      appointed IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A person in relation to an aircraft`
`a person in relation to an aircraft` MEANS `A person in relation to an aircraft` WITH `has control of the aircraft at that time` IS control, `is appointed over the one who has control at that time` IS appointed

GIVEN control IS A BOOLEAN
      appointed IS A BOOLEAN
      navigator IS A BOOLEAN
      harbourMaster IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A person in relation to a ship`
`a person in relation to a ship` MEANS `A person in relation to a ship` WITH `has control of a ship or vessel` IS control, `is appointed over the ship or vessel at that time` IS appointed, `a navigator` IS navigator, `a harbour master` IS harbourMaster

GIVEN gov IS A BOOLEAN
      stateDoc IS A BOOLEAN
      authorised IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A printer`
`a printer` MEANS `A printer` WITH `the Government Printer of Israel` IS gov, `the thing printed is an enactment or a State document` IS stateDoc, `the Government authorised it, generally or specially, to print that enactment or document` IS authorised

GIVEN gov IS A BOOLEAN
      legislative IS A BOOLEAN
      published IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A notice`
`a notice` MEANS `A notice` WITH `of the Government or on its behalf` IS gov, `of legislative effect` IS legislative, `published in Reshumot` IS published

GIVEN act IS A BOOLEAN
      attempt IS A BOOLEAN
      omission IS A BOOLEAN
      punishable IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A deed`
`a deed` MEANS `A deed` WITH `an act` IS act, `an attempt` IS attempt, `an omission` IS omission, `the law on it is punishment` IS punishable

GIVEN ordinary IS A BOOLEAN
      imposed IS A BOOLEAN
      fills IS A BOOLEAN
      supervised IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A worker or office`
`a worker or office` MEANS `A worker or office` WITH `a public servant or public office in the ordinary sense` IS ordinary, `duties of an official character are imposed on it` IS imposed, `it fills duties of that character` IS fills, `under the direct supervision of a government` IS supervised

GIVEN word IS A `A division word`
      ofThis IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A division referred to`
`a division referred to` MEANS `A division referred to` WITH `the word used` IS word, `of the enactment in which the word appears` IS ofThis

GIVEN isDoctor IS A BOOLEAN
      inState IS A BOOLEAN
      inIsrael IS A BOOLEAN
      underLaw IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A doctor`
`a doctor` MEANS `A doctor` WITH `a doctor` IS isDoctor, `in the service of the State` IS inState, `registered in Israel as a doctor` IS inIsrael, `registered under the law in force at that time on the registration of doctors` IS underLaw

GIVEN ordinary IS A BOOLEAN
      listed IS A BOOLEAN
      open IS A BOOLEAN
      uses IS A BOOLEAN
      enters IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A way or place`
`a way or place` MEANS `A way or place` WITH `a street or road in the ordinary sense` IS ordinary, `of one of the kinds listed` IS listed, `an open place` IS open, `the public uses it or customarily passes through it` IS uses, `the public enters it or may enter it` IS enters, `a highway` IS FALSE, `an avenue` IS FALSE, `a lane` IS FALSE, `a bridle path` IS FALSE, `a footpath` IS FALSE, `a square` IS FALSE, `a courtyard` IS FALSE, `a promenade` IS FALSE, `an alley` IS FALSE, `a passage` IS FALSE

GIVEN like IS A BOOLEAN
      inForce IS A BOOLEAN
      provides IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A local body under the Ordinance`
`a local body under the Ordinance` MEANS `A local body under the Ordinance` WITH `a municipality, a local council or an authority like them` IS like, `constituted by a law in force at that time` IS inForce, `that law provides for the establishment of local-government authorities` IS provides, `a municipality` IS FALSE, `a local council` IS FALSE, `an authority like them` IS FALSE

GIVEN ordinary IS A BOOLEAN
      useful IS A BOOLEAN
      employee IS A BOOLEAN
      guarding IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A holding of land under the Ordinance`
`a holding under the Ordinance` MEANS `A holding of land under the Ordinance` WITH `possession in the ordinary sense` IS ordinary, `use, residence, possession or enjoyment` IS useful, `as an employee or official only` IS employee, `for supervision or guarding only` IS guarding, `use` IS FALSE, `residence` IS FALSE, `possession` IS FALSE, `enjoyment` IS FALSE

GIVEN ordinaryFlag IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A navigable thing`
`a ship fact` MEANS `A navigable thing` WITH `used for navigation` IS TRUE, `propelled by oars or paddles only` IS FALSE

-- "Israel" at sea
GIVEN miles IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A place`
`a place at sea` MEANS `A place` WITH `in the territory of the State in the ordinary sense` IS FALSE, `its position, if it is at sea` IS JUST (`a point at sea` miles)

