#ASSERT NOT (`Ordinance s 1 "rules of procedure" — the rules are the court's rules of procedure:` (`A set of rules` WITH `rules for the practice and procedure of the court` IS TRUE, `made by an authority empowered at that time to make regulations or give orders` IS FALSE))  -- S579 [Ord s.1 O114]

-- Where the Law and the Ordinance differ
#ASSERT `s 3 "determined" — it was determined, being determined` `in the enactment in which the expression appears`  -- S580 [Law s.3 L51 vs Ord s.1 O78] (Law: "נקבע" in the enactment that uses it, a regulation included)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 3 "district" — the division is a district:` (`A division of the State's area` WITH `it is an administrative district` IS TRUE, `the area of the State is divided into it by the Government` IS FALSE, `the division is made by virtue of` IS `no statute`))  -- S581 [Law s.3 L44 vs Ord s.1 O64]
#ASSERT NOT (`s 3 "regulation" — the instrument is a regulation:` (`test instrument` TRUE TRUE FALSE (JUST `a Knesset law`)))  -- S582 [Law s.3 L62 vs Ord s.1 O112]
#ASSERT `s 3 "administrative direction" — the instrument is an administrative direction:` (`test instrument` TRUE TRUE FALSE (JUST `a Knesset law`))  -- S583 [Law s.3 L37 vs Ord s.1 O112]
#ASSERT `s 3 "local authority" — the body is one:` `a union of towns`  -- S584 [Law s.3 L56 vs Ord s.1 O101]

§§ `I. Ordinance ss 16(4), 17, 19, 42 and the repealed Chapters; J. Not covered`

GIVEN conferred IS A BOOLEAN
      contradicts IS A BOOLEAN
      otherIntention IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A regulation measured against s 16(4) of the Ordinance`
`a regulation tested against s 16(4)` MEANS `A regulation measured against s 16(4) of the Ordinance` WITH `the power to make it was conferred by a law` IS conferred, `it contradicts a provision of a law` IS contradicts, `another intention is implied` IS otherIntention

GIVEN needed IS A BOOLEAN
      implied IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A power that an enactment gives before its commencement`
`a power in Law Z` MEANS `A power that an enactment gives before its commencement` WITH `the day the enactment was given` IS YMD 2025 1 1, `the day the enactment commences` IS YMD 2025 7 1, `using the power seems necessary or proper to operate the enactment on its commencement day` IS needed, `another intention is implied` IS implied

`a power in a law that commences on the day it is given` MEANS `A power that an enactment gives before its commencement` WITH `the day the enactment was given` IS YMD 2025 1 1, `the day the enactment commences` IS YMD 2025 1 1, `using the power seems necessary or proper to operate the enactment on its commencement day` IS TRUE, `another intention is implied` IS FALSE

-- Whether a regulation, appointment or thing done under the power is valid on a day: s 19's earliest day.
GIVEN p IS A `A power that an enactment gives before its commencement`
      neededToOperate IS A BOOLEAN
      d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`valid on` MEANS
    CONSIDER `Ordinance s 19 — the earliest day a regulation made under the power of` p `may be valid, when it was needed to operate the enactment:` neededToOperate
    WHEN `not before the day the enactment commences` first THEN d AT LEAST first
    WHEN `s 19 sets no earliest day` THEN TRUE

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Ordinance section survives` MEANS `s 31 — the Ordinance's section` n `, subsection` NOTHING `, survives the Law`

